OL,5,G0110 Autopsy
OL,6,     FOver 30 years after Bob Marley's
OL,7,     Fdeath, Forensic Pathologist Dr.
OL,8,     FMichael Hunter re-examines his
OL,9,     Fmedical records to uncover his
OL,10,     Ftrue cause of death. (Ep1)
OL,11,G0210 Autopsy
OL,12,     FIn April 1994, Kurt Cobain was
OL,13,     Ffound dead at his home. Dr.
OL,14,     FMichael Hunter has analysed the
OL,15,     Fmedical evidence and testimonies
OL,16,     Ffrom family and friends to uncover
OL,17,     Fthe true cause his death. (Ep2)
